# Installation password gate DISABLED (no-op).
#
# This file is imported when OCTBASE_SITE_PASSWORD_HASH is empty/unset — the
# Caddyfiles import `auth-{$OCTBASE_SITE_AUTH:}.caddy`, and compose derives
# OCTBASE_SITE_AUTH="on" only when a hash is set, otherwise empty (which selects
# this file). It intentionally contains no directives so the front door serves
# openly. See auth-on.caddy for the enabled counterpart and docs/operations.md
# → "Installation password".
